46
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:34,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-san!</font>

47
00:02:45,010 --> 00:02:46,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My left ear...</font>

48
00:02:48,980 --> 00:02:51,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a little gimmick I have.</font>

49
00:02:53,110 --> 00:02:58,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Evading won't work...
