50
00:03:00,990 --> 00:03:02,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is he going to do?!</font>

51
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:07,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's sound.</font>

52
00:03:07,870 --> 00:03:12,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though you evaded my fist,
