53
00:03:12,790 --> 00:03:13,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sound?</font>

54
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:19,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know what sound is
