55
00:03:21,130 --> 00:03:22,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Vibration?</font>

56
00:03:22,550 --> 00:03:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Correct. In other words,
hearing sounds means,</font>

57
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:33,230
