91
00:06:11,550 --> 00:06:13,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a speaker of sorts!</font>

92
00:06:15,390 --> 00:06:16,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-san!</font>

93
00:06:17,350 --> 00:06:20,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the assault sound isn't limited
