103
00:06:57,680 --> 00:07:00,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you gonna do, Ino?</font>

104
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:02,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

105
00:07:04,070 --> 00:07:06,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, Sakura's in deep trouble!</font>

106
00:07:06,860 --> 00:07:08,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're all right with that?</font>

107
00:07:08,490 --> 00:07:09,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

108
00:07:10,150 --> 00:07:12,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You two were once close friends,
weren't you?</font>

109
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way...</font>

110
00:07:26,250 --> 00:07:29,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What Sakura, don't be so stiff!</font>

111
00:07:31,590 --> 00:07:32,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

112
00:07:33,550 --> 00:07:35,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino-chan, I hear you also...</font>

113
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

114
00:07:40,430 --> 00:07:43,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...like Sasuke-kun.</font>

115
00:07:53,610 --> 00:07:56,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, that means from now on,</font>

116
00:07:56,990 --> 00:07:58,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you and I are rivals.</font>

117
00:08:08,460 --> 00:08:12,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... why am I recalling things
from that time?</font>

118
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Ino!</font>

119
00:08:16,930 --> 00:08:18,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you gonna do?!</font>

120
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:21,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know, but there's nothing I can do!</font>

121
00:08:21,850 --> 00:08:23,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't heedlessly
go out there, can I?!</font>

122
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:29,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I went out now...</font>

123
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:34,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd be taken down without a doubt.</font>

124
00:08:35,990 --> 00:08:36,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I also...</font>

125
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I also...!</font>

126
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:47,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Air pressure!
The shurikens got bounced back?!</font>

127
00:08:57,550 --> 00:08:59,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your hair's shinier than mine.</font>

128
00:09:00,510 --> 00:09:04,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! If you have time to worry
about your hair,</font>

129
00:09:04,100 --> 00:09:05,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you should practice!</font>

130
00:09:06,020 --> 00:09:08,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Getting all spiced up like a woman...</font>

131
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:14,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you kill that Sasuke guy
right in front of this sexy bug, Zaku?</font>

132
00:09:15,150 --> 00:09:17,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! That sounds great!</font>

133
00:09:17,620 --> 00:09:18,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey hey...</font>

134
00:09:19,410 --> 00:09:21,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you do such a thing!</font>

135
00:09:21,620 --> 00:09:22,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't move!</font>

136
00:09:25,460 --> 00:09:26,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-san.</font>

137
00:09:28,290 --> 00:09:32,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body... It has no strength.</font>

138
00:09:46,140 --> 00:09:47,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

139
00:09:49,270 --> 00:09:53,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Again... I'm just pulling everyone's feet!</font>

140
00:09:55,820 --> 00:09:57,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm always being protected.</font>

141
00:09:58,530 --> 00:09:59,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's so frustrating!</font>

142
00:10:02,490 --> 00:10:04,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time for sure...
I had thought!</font>

143
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:07,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time for sure...</font>

144
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:11,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must protect people precious to me...
so I thought!</font>

145
00:10:17,420 --> 00:10:18,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So...</font>

146
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:19,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's do this!</font>

147
00:10:36,690 --> 00:10:39,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Sasuke and Naruto are
gonna get it, too!</font>

148
00:10:42,950 --> 00:10:45,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What should I do?!</font>

149
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:54,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's pointless!</font>

150
00:10:56,170 --> 00:10:58,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That won't work on me!</font>

151
00:11:03,010 --> 00:11:04,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying?</font>

152
00:11:04,810 --> 00:11:05,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

153
00:11:06,060 --> 00:11:06,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

154
00:11:38,420 --> 00:11:39,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I always...</font>

155
00:11:41,050 --> 00:11:44,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">act as if I'm a full-fledged Ninja.</font>

156
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:49,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I always say that I like Sasuke-kun.</font>

157
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:55,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I always act like I know everything
and lecture Naruto.</font>

158
00:11:58,030 --> 00:12:03,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I always just... watch them from behind.</font>

159
00:12:06,740 --> 00:12:07,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And yet...</font>

160
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:10,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tazuna, get back!</font>

161
00:12:20,170 --> 00:12:21,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get back!</font>

162
00:12:29,970 --> 00:12:31,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then...</font>

163
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:33,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's get wild!</font>

164
00:12:44,150 --> 00:12:47,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the only way to
take him down!</font>

165
00:12:47,950 --> 00:12:49,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

166
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:03,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it is!</font>

167
00:13:06,010 --> 00:13:10,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those two always covered
my back and fought for me.</font>

168
00:13:18,860 --> 00:13:23,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-san, you say that you like me...</font>

169
00:13:25,900 --> 00:13:27,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll protect you until I die!</font>

170
00:13:32,790 --> 00:13:34,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Primary Lotus!</font>

171
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:38,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With me at your back...</font>

172
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:41,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you risked your life and
fought for me.</font>

173
00:13:42,500 --> 00:13:45,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a feeling that you taught me...</font>

174
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:51,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

175
00:13:52,350 --> 00:13:53,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-san!</font>

176
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:55,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph!</font>

177
00:13:57,190 --> 00:14:00,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to be like all of you!</font>

178
00:14:05,610 --> 00:14:06,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time...</font>

179
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:08,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want all of you...</font>

180
00:14:11,030 --> 00:14:12,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to watch me...</font>

181
00:14:14,830 --> 00:14:16,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...from behind!</font>

182
00:14:21,090 --> 00:14:22,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura?</font>

183
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:24,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

184
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:28,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kin! Kill her!</font>

185
00:14:32,350 --> 00:14:34,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh! That sign...</font>

186
00:14:40,690 --> 00:14:41,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Substitution Jutsu!</font>

187
00:14:43,190 --> 00:14:46,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On the right, huh?
You think I'm a fool?</font>

188
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:48,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With such a simple and basic Ninjutsu...</font>

189
00:14:48,450 --> 00:14:50,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you think you can come at me?!</font>

190
00:14:51,660 --> 00:14:52,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kin, get out of the way!</font>

191
00:14:54,790 --> 00:14:55,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Useless!</font>

192
00:14:56,660 --> 00:15:00,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Air pressure 100 percent,
ultrasonic waves 0%, output...</font>

193
00:15:01,170 --> 00:15:02,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that all you can do?</font>

194
00:15:03,090 --> 00:15:04,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Slicing Sound Wave!</font>

195
00:15:07,050 --> 00:15:08,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're easy to spot...
You're above!</font>

196
00:15:11,890 --> 00:15:15,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've said it two or three times that
that won't work!</font>

197
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:18,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is enough... for you!</font>

198
00:15:22,150 --> 00:15:23,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where next?</font>

199
00:15:25,270 --> 00:15:25,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

200
00:15:26,570 --> 00:15:27,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?!</font>

201
00:15:28,650 --> 00:15:31,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time... it's not a substitution!</font>

202
00:15:41,370 --> 00:15:42,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get off me! Hey!</font>

203
00:15:47,670 --> 00:15:48,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

204
00:15:58,390 --> 00:16:02,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're always being called
"Billboard Brow" and being picked on.</font>

205
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:06,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you?</font>

206
00:16:07,190 --> 00:16:11,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm called Yamanaka Ino.
How ‘bout you?</font>

207
00:16:12,990 --> 00:16:16,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... Sakura.</font>

208
00:16:16,700 --> 00:16:22,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? I can't hear you.
Say it louder.</font>

209
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:25,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haruno Sakura!</font>

210
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:29,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, I see.</font>

211
00:16:29,880 --> 00:16:32,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have a wide forehead.</font>

212
00:16:32,300 --> 00:16:34,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, Billboard Brow, huh...?</font>

213
00:16:36,390 --> 00:16:39,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why you hide
your forehead with your bangs.</font>

214
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:41,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like a ghost...</font>

215
00:16:48,270 --> 00:16:49,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, was it?</font>

216
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:51,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-huh...</font>

217
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:55,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come back here tomorrow.</font>

218
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:58,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give you something nice.</font>

219
00:16:58,780 --> 00:16:59,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

220
00:17:01,410 --> 00:17:02,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn, let go!</font>

221
00:17:05,040 --> 00:17:09,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See! You look cuter like this, Sakura!</font>

222
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:11,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give you that ribbon.</font>

223
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:15,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-Thanks.</font>

224
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:17,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

225
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:18,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what?</font>

226
00:17:20,180 --> 00:17:21,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My forehead...</font>

227
00:17:22,350 --> 00:17:26,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You hide it, so people make
more fun of you, you know?!</font>

228
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:31,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have a cute face Sakura,
so you should be more confident!</font>

229
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:32,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More confident!</font>

230
00:17:33,490 --> 00:17:34,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino-chan...</font>

231
00:17:38,490 --> 00:17:42,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, who's that?
Who's she, Ino-chan?</font>

232
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:44,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Her name's Sakura.</font>

233
00:17:44,870 --> 00:17:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, say hello!</font>

234
00:17:49,250 --> 00:17:50,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hello...</font>

235
00:17:54,380 --> 00:17:55,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen everybody! Listen!</font>

236
00:17:56,880 --> 00:18:01,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's someone I like!
Who do you think it is?</font>

237
00:18:02,060 --> 00:18:03,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and tell us!</font>

238
00:18:04,270 --> 00:18:06,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say it's Sasuke-kun?</font>

239
00:18:06,980 --> 00:18:09,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Why'd you know?</font>

240
00:18:09,900 --> 00:18:11,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you talking about?</font>

241
00:18:11,690 --> 00:18:15,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun's really popular,
he's the most popular!</font>

242
00:18:15,280 --> 00:18:17,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Is that so?</font>

243
00:18:17,950 --> 00:18:22,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no! I'll have a lot of rivals.
What should I do?!</font>

244
00:18:22,870 --> 00:18:27,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Ino! Sakura's been upbeat lately!</font>

245
00:18:30,170 --> 00:18:32,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's just acting brave
and romping around!</font>

246
00:18:36,670 --> 00:18:42,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino-chan! I've heard Sasuke-kun
likes girls with long hair.</font>

247
00:18:43,060 --> 00:18:49,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...likes girls with long hair.
...likes girls with long hair.</font>

248
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:50,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

249
00:18:52,110 --> 00:18:55,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've heard you like Sasuke-kun, too, Ino-chan.</font>

250
00:18:57,440 --> 00:18:59,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From now on, we're rivals.</font>

251
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:06,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your hair. It's grown quite a bit.</font>

252
00:19:07,790 --> 00:19:08,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino...</font>

253
00:19:09,410 --> 00:19:10,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...</font>

254
00:19:12,130 --> 00:19:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you on the
same team as Sasuke-kun?!</font>

255
00:19:16,760 --> 00:19:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will not lose anymore... to you, Ino!</font>

256
00:19:20,510 --> 00:19:27,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me too! I won't lose to you, Sakura.
No matter what!</font>

257
00:19:44,030 --> 00:19:45,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...Sakura!</font>

258
00:19:50,830 --> 00:19:51,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will...</font>

259
00:19:52,080 --> 00:19:53,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will...</font>

260
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:09,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give it up!</font>

261
00:20:10,770 --> 00:20:11,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's really bad...</font>

262
00:20:13,980 --> 00:20:15,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Ino...!</font>

263
00:20:19,230 --> 00:20:22,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must... protect everyone!</font>

264
00:20:23,610 --> 00:20:24,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You punk!</font>

265
00:20:38,420 --> 00:20:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

266
00:20:40,710 --> 00:20:44,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh! More strange ones.</font>

267
00:20:44,890 --> 00:20:46,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino...?</font>

268
00:20:49,060 --> 00:20:53,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura! I promised
I wouldn't lose to you, didn't I?!</font>

269
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:10,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

